{"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"Presenting from a link","modules":[{"name":"OID4VCWallet"}],"role":"article","roleHeading":"Article"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Answer a Verifier’s OpenID4VP request: show who is asking and what,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"let the holder choose, and present exactly that."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Presenting from a link","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation","doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/RequestLink"],"anchor":"Presenting-from-a-link"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingFromALink","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A Verifier asks with an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp:\/\/"},{"type":"text","text":" link, as a QR code or a link on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its page. Register the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"openid4vp"},{"type":"text","text":" URL scheme in the app’s Info.plist so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"links open the app, and hand the link to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet\/startPresentation(request:)"},{"text":". It fetches the Verifier’s","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"signed request, checks its certificate against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/verifierRoots","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", and finds the credentials that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can answer it. A request from a Verifier the wallet doesn’t trust","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"throws ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/untrustedVerifier","type":"reference"},{"text":" before anything is shown.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation"},{"text":" it returns says:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"who is asking: ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/verifier-swift.property","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", its name, and its"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Registration"},{"text":" when a registrar the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"wallet trusts (","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/registrarRoots","type":"reference"},{"text":") registered it,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with its purpose and the claims it’s registered to ask for;"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"what it asks for: "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/queries","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", each with the held"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"credentials that can answer it, and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/credentialSets","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the request’s alternatives."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Present","anchor":"Present"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import Foundation","import OID4VCWallet","","\/\/\/ Answers a request link: `confirm` shows the holder who is asking and","\/\/\/ what sharing would disclose, and returns whether they agree. Returns","\/\/\/ where to send the browser, when the Verifier asks.","func present(requestLink: String, wallet: Wallet,","             confirm: (Presentation, [Presentation.Disclosure]) async -> Bool) async throws -> URL? {","    let presentation = try await wallet.startPresentation(request: requestLink)","    guard presentation.isAnswerable else {","        return try await presentation.decline().redirectURI","    }","    let selection = try await presentation.defaultSelection()","    let disclosures = try await presentation.preview(selection: selection)","    guard await confirm(presentation, disclosures) else {","        return try await presentation.decline().redirectURI","    }","    \/\/ The holder key signs now: Face ID, if the key store asks for it.","    return try await presentation.respond(selection: selection).redirectURI","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/defaultSelection()"},{"text":" picks the first credential that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"answers each query, and the first answerable option of each credential","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"set. To let the holder choose, build a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Selection"},{"text":" from","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each query’s ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Query\/credentials","type":"reference"},{"text":" instead: a query that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"takes one credential gets exactly one. The wallet presents exactly the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"selection, after checking it answers the request","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletError\/Code-swift.struct\/invalidSelection","type":"reference"},{"text":" otherwise), and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/preview(selection:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" says what it would disclose","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without signing or sending anything: show that before the holder","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"agrees.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Open ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Presentation\/Presented\/redirectURI"},{"type":"text","text":", when the Verifier sends"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one, in the browser the request came from: it’s how a same-device"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"flow returns to the Verifier’s page."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Show what’s being asked beyond a registration","anchor":"Show-whats-being-asked-beyond-a-registration"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For a Verifier with a verified registration, each query’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documen